-- tools/course-banks/forecastml/intermediate.
--
-- What this tier owns: TESTING A FORECAST HONESTLY. Errors as actual minus
-- forecast, bias, MAE and RMSE; MAPE and a zero actual, sMAPE on 0 to 200;
-- MASE scaled by the training months' naive error and its lag; rolling-origin
-- backtests with an expanding window, refitted or held, and leakage; pooled
-- and by-horizon metrics, each origin its own scale; methods compared on the
-- same origins. Digest sections 11 to 17, and section 25.
--
-- THE TRAP THE TIER IS BUILT ON. A forecast is judged on months it never saw,
-- with a metric that stays defined through a shut-in month. The Professional
-- capstone grades six Professional quantities.
-- ============================================================================

